{{- if .HasProtectedBranches}}

## Protected Branches

`{{.ProtectedBranchesDesc}}` are **protected**. Don't commit on or push to them (coi's git hooks reject it) — use a feature branch (`git switch -c <name>`) and a PR. They may only point at commits the remote already has: `git pull` / `git reset --hard origin/<branch>` work; cherry-pick, revert, `am`, merge, rebase or reset onto local-only commits are refused.
{{- end}}

